<title>UK: Italy eyes jumbo mark Eurobond - London dealers.</title>
<headline>Italy eyes jumbo mark Eurobond - London dealers.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy could launch a mark Eurobond for at least 1.0 billion marks next week, syndicate managers said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;Italy is considering a deal for a minimum of 1.0 billion marks at a five- to seven-year maturity, and will decide today or tomorrow whether to go ahead with it,&quot; a syndicate manager in Frankfurt said. Traders said a five-year issue would likely be launched at an 8-10 basis point spread over government bonds.</p>
<p>-- Aline van Duyn, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
